OL,3,GNEWSALong delays for motorists after
OL,4,AM42 crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FMotorists face delays of 70 minutes
OL,7,Fafter a crash temporarily closed a
OL,8,Fsection of the M42 during the Monday
OL,9,Fmorning rush hour.
OL,11,FThe collision occurred on the M42
OL,12,Fsouthbound between junction 10 for
OL,13,FKenilworth and junction 9 for Curdworth
OL,14,Fin Warwickshire.
OL,16,FNational Highways announced the closure
OL,17,Fat around 07:20 BST, later confirming
OL,18,Fall lanes had reopened at 08:30.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
