OL,3,GNEWSALong delays for motorists after
OL,4,AM42 crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FRecovery has now been completed, but
OL,7,FNational Highways warned there were
OL,8,Fseven miles of congestion on approach.
OL,9,FThe BBC has contacted West Midlands
OL,10,FAmbulance Service for comment.
